      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>PART I, LINE 3</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE YMCA OF SAN DIEGO COUNTY HOUSING SERVICES, INC HAS NO EMPLOYEES AND THEREFORE RELIES ON EMPLOYEES OF THE YMCA OF SAN DIEGO COUNTY (YSDC) TO CONDUCT BUSINESS. THE EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION COMMITTEE OF THE BOARD OF YSDC DETERMINES THE COMPENSATION OF THE TREASURER OF HOUSING SERVICES, WHO IS ALSO EVP AND CFO OF YSDC. THE EXECUTIVE COMPENSATION COMMITTEE, WHICH IS COMPOSED OF INDEPENDENT DIRECTORS, RELIES ON REPORTS OF INDEPENDENT COMPENSATION CONSULTANTS AND COMPENSATION SURVEYS TO DETERMINE THE APPROPRIATE LEVEL OF COMPENSATION AND IT IS APPROVED BY THE YSDC BOARD OF DIRECTORS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
